\subsection{Capability Ceiling vs.\ Diversity Collapse}\label{sec:yun_contrast}

\citet{yun2025price} identify \textit{diversity collapse}: constrained decoding suppresses token-level diversity; our LP compression (median 0.041 nats) corroborates this.
